# PingMon server environment file.
# Copy to .env (which is git-ignored) and set your API tokens.
#
# Tokens authorize API access via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
# Each token must be a lowercase uuid4. Multiple tokens may be comma-separated
# and/or supplied on repeated `token=` lines (and/or via repeatable --token flags).
#
# If no token is configured anywhere, the API is fully open.

# token=3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301,a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d
